# Lemma's virtual terminal, not the terminal hosting an attached client.
# The base matches the existing xterm-compatible Ghostty input/VT contract.
# Cursor shape (Ss/Se) and color (Cs/Cr) are inherited because Lemma presents
# the focused Pane's canonical cursor. Application clipboard writes remain absent
# until the native clipboard policy supports that contract.
lemma|Lemma terminal multiplexer,
	Tc, RGB,
	Ms@,
	Smulx=\E[4:%p1%dm,
	Setulc=\E[58:2::%p1%{65536}%/%d:%p1%{256}%/%{255}%&%d:%p1%{255}%&%dm,
	use=xterm-256color,
